1
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:01,750
Later,

2
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,150
let it keep you company.

3
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:09,950
This is...

4
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,490
The exact same

5
00:01:14,230 --> 00:01:15,890
sleeping doll from back then.

6
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:18,039
But when you were little,

7
00:01:18,370 --> 00:01:20,700
why did you always like holding this doll?

8
00:01:23,330 --> 00:01:25,010
[Dearest Episode 11]

9
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:29,430
That was a sleeping doll Wen Xin gave me.

10
00:01:30,539 --> 00:01:32,740
Back when she still acted like a mother,

11
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:37,259
she would always comfort me
to sleep with this doll.

12
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:40,479
So much so that later, without it,

13
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,310
I couldn't even sleep.

14
00:01:45,710 --> 00:01:47,039
Let it stay with you

15
00:01:48,170 --> 00:01:49,700
for the rest of this journey

16
00:01:50,729 --> 00:01:51,700
in my place.

17
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:09,850
Thank you.

18
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,030
Jiang Yu.

19
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,190
Be careful.

20
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:58,000
♪ Holding tightly to my hands and scars ♪

21
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:02,020
♪ Your deep breathing ♪

22
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:05,750
♪ Guided like the stars ♪

23
00:03:06,250 --> 00:03:13,630
♪ Now I'll never let you go ♪

24
00:03:13,660 --> 00:03:19,960
♪ At the edge of this breaking world ♪

25
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,400
Go

26
00:03:20,340 --> 00:03:24,660
♪ You are the only one
who brought the light ♪

27
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:27,520
♪ Because it's you ♪

28
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:29,040
♪ All my sorrows ♪

29
00:03:29,070 --> 00:03:34,390
♪ Fading out of sight ♪

30
00:03:34,410 --> 00:03:42,090
♪ In your arms, I'm born again and new ♪

31
00:03:42,370 --> 00:03:45,340
♪ All the cruel darkness fades away ♪

32
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:49,140
♪ And you bring the colors of the day ♪

33
00:03:49,230 --> 00:03:58,360
♪ I will stay by your side ever-more ♪

34
00:03:58,460 --> 00:04:08,760
♪ The only one who brought me through ♪

35
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:19,120
♪ Because it's you. ♪

36
00:05:00,340 --> 00:05:01,910
Something's wrong.

37
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,400
Jianan.

38
00:05:23,870 --> 00:05:25,120
Don't let her live.

39
00:05:25,730 --> 00:05:26,650
You handle it.

40
00:05:30,610 --> 00:05:33,050
Your leader was bought off by Jiang Yu.

41
00:05:33,130 --> 00:05:33,930
Work with me,

42
00:05:34,450 --> 00:05:36,110
and you will be the new leader.

43
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,000
Please go. I'll handle things here.

44
00:07:09,890 --> 00:07:11,740
What a perfect face

45
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,720
and such healthy vitals.

46
00:07:15,750 --> 00:07:18,870
Mr. He actually wants to
dispose of you on the spot.

47
00:07:19,430 --> 00:07:21,260
What a waste!

48
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,790
Don't worry.

49
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,070
I have a client

50
00:07:27,930 --> 00:07:29,640
who likes exactly your type.

51
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,800
Rare blood type,

52
00:07:32,020 --> 00:07:34,409
fresh parts.

53
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:40,260
Before we take you apart and ship you off,

54
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:43,159
we have plenty of time

55
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:45,960
to take good care of you.

56
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,159
Go away!

57
00:07:56,530 --> 00:07:57,360
Let her go!

58
00:07:59,010 --> 00:08:00,890
You got here fast enough.

59
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:04,390
Mr. He clearly underestimated you.

60
00:08:04,950 --> 00:08:05,750
But...

61
00:08:14,270 --> 00:08:17,310
This is my place.

62
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:22,320
You can get in
but never get out in a snake pit.

63
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,750
Get him!

64
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,390
Jiang Yu!

65
00:09:00,150 --> 00:09:00,960
Jiang Yu!

66
00:09:15,900 --> 00:09:16,690
Jiang Yu!
